            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-diagramconnector" Title="DiagramConnector" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Connector.Length, "properties")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Properties" Title="DiagramConnector" Rows="Vocab.Connector" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-diagramnodeclickeventargs" Title="DiagramNodeClickEventArgs" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.ClickArgs.Length, "properties")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Properties" Title="DiagramNodeClickEventArgs" Rows="Vocab.ClickArgs" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-diagramcontrolshape" Title="DiagramControlShape" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Shapes.Length, "values")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Values" Title="DiagramControlShape" Rows="Vocab.Shapes" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-connectortype" Title="ConnectorType" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Types.Length, "values")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Values" Title="ConnectorType" Rows="Vocab.Types" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-diagramport" Title="DiagramPort" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Ports.Length, "values")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Values" Title="DiagramPort" Rows="Vocab.Ports" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-arrowstyle" Title="ArrowStyle" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Arrows.Length, "values")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Values" Title="ArrowStyle" Rows="Vocab.Arrows" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-imagefit" Title="ImageFit" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Fits.Length, "values")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Values" Title="ImageFit" Rows="Vocab.Fits" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-css-classes" Title="CSS classes" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Css.Length, "classes")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.CssClasses" Title="CSS classes" Rows="Vocab.Css" />
            </DocSection>
            <DocSection Id="doc-css-variables" Title="CSS variables" Count='@DocSection.Label(Vocab.Vars.Length, "variables")'>
                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.CssVariables" Title="CSS variables" Rows="Vocab.Vars" />
                <p>Fill, outline and text colours come from the node and connector properties, not from CSS variables.</p>
            </DocSection>
        </DocSections>
    </Vocabulary>

    <Accessibility>
        <ul>
            <li>Nodes are SVG <code>&lt;g&gt;</code> elements with a click handler and nothing else: no <code>tabindex</code>, role or key handling, so they cannot be reached or activated from the keyboard, and the <code>&lt;svg&gt;</code> has no role or accessible name. Offer another route to the same actions; in the first example the Previous step and Next step buttons walk every step, and the panel is an <code>aria-live="polite"</code> region.</li>
            <li><code>DiagramControl</code> does not capture extra attributes, so an <code>aria-label</code> passed to it throws at render time. Put any description on an element around it.</li>
            <li>Labels, sublabels, icons and connector labels are SVG <code>&lt;text&gt;</code>, real text rather than pictures of text.</li>
            <li><code>Tooltip</code> becomes an SVG <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, the node's first child; browsers show it on hover. A disabled node has <code>pointer-events: none</code>, so its tooltip never appears.</li>
            <li>A disabled node is marked only visually, by 45% opacity and a close icon <code>&lt;image&gt;</code> that has no text alternative.</li>
            <li>Contrast is up to the page. White text on the default <code>#4A90D9</code> fill is about 3.3:1, under the WCAG AA 4.5:1 for text this size; the fills on this page reach at least 5:1 against their text colour. Sublabels are drawn at 85% opacity, which brings the white ones here down to about 4.2:1 on blue and 4.4:1 on teal.</li>
        </ul>
    </Accessibility>

    <Related>
        <ul>
            <li>Tasks with dependency links on a timeline: <a href="demo/gantt">Gantt chart</a>.</li>
            <li>Hierarchies as an expandable list: <a href="demo/tree/treeview-explorer">Tree view</a>.</li>
            <li>The package cost sheet the second example links to: <a href="demo/reports/package-costs">Report writer</a>.</li>
        </ul>
    </Related>
</FeatureDemoLayout>

